;
; cubicraftia.tres - Project-wide Theme resource per UI-SPEC.md Design System.
;
; Typography ladder (UI-SPEC §Typography):
;   Body:    16px regular (400)  - Label font_size default
;   Label:   14px semibold (600) - Button, section labels
;   Heading: 20px semibold (600) - Panel titles, dialog titles
;   Display: 28px semibold (600) - Reserved for Phase 6 title screen
;
; Color roles (UI-SPEC §Color):
;   Dominant (60%): #1B2C56 navy (0.85 alpha for HUD panels)
;   Secondary (30%): #F1F0EA brick white
;   Accent (10%): #F5C30D brick yellow - selected hotbar slot ring, active Auto chip
;   Destructive: #D63828 brick red - Reset button, error toast border
;
; NOTE: Font references are loaded at runtime by scripts after Godot imports them.
; The Theme sets font sizes via per-control overrides; the actual FontFile is set
; dynamically by src/autoload/features.gd _ready (or by the editor after import).
; This avoids headless-mode import failures.

[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

